		<link>https://www.fly4free.com/news/christmas-beyond-europe-10-christmas-markets-around-the-world-worth-visiting-in-2026/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Dmytro]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:10:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Christmas 2026]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[christmas markets]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Christmas travel]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[travel tips]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.fly4free.com/?p=778564</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Christmas markets aren't just about Germany, Austria or the Czech Republic. This winter, festive villages filled with market stalls, Christmas decorations and thousands of twinkling lights will once again spring up thousands of kilometres beyond Europe. In Tokyo, a Christmas market will take place beneath the city's iconic tower; in Dubai, festive attractions will be set among palm trees and traditional Arabian architecture; and in Brazil, visitors can enjoy a Christmas festival lasting almost three months. We've selected ten Christmas markets around the world whose organisers have already confirmed their plans for 2026.]]></description>
		
		
		
			</item>
